+// Fix28 Vulkan layer test (Test\RTX20_VulkanLayerTest.exe). The runtime
+// module beside it (normal.asi, or new.asi in the package's Test folder) is
+// loaded the way an ASI loader does, registers its Vulkan layer for this
+// process, and the Vulkan loader inserts it into a Win32 swapchain's call
+// chain. On an RTX 20/30 the frames pass through the D3D11 bridge and NVIDIA
+// optical flow (the status line counts generated presents); elsewhere (Wine
+// in the build's validation) frames pass through. PASS: every frame of the
+// test was presented. Arguments: [frames=300] [fifo|immediate|mailbox].
+// With SMVK_TEST_CHILD_DIR set, a copy started from that folder inherits the
+// environment and must load the module as a forwarding layer only.
